    "note": "Headline ink solido + \"cripto\" em outline ink (stroke), branco limpo, CTA verde fill texto ink, accent rosa.",
    "html": "<section class=\"lab-outline-a\" style=\"height:100%;min-height:520px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden;position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;background:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;\"><style>.lab-outline-a h1,.lab-outline-a h1 *{white-space:normal !important;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-break:normal;} .lab-outline-a{overflow:hidden;}</style>\n  <style>\n    .lab-outline-a *{box-sizing:border-box;}\n    .lab-outline-a .oa-wrap{position:relative;width:100%;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px;z-index:3;text-align:center;}\n    .lab-outline-a .oa-eyebrow{font-family:'Gridlite',monospace;font-size:clamp(10px,1.1vw,12.5px);letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6258;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:0 0 26px;}\n    .lab-outline-a .oa-eyebrow .oa-dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#7CF067;display:inline-block;flex:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(124,240,103,.18);}\n    .lab-outline-a h1{font-family:'Atelier',sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#14110D;font-size:clamp(38px,7vw,82px);line-height:0.98;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 auto;max-width:14ch;}\n    .lab-outline-a h1 .oa-out{color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:2px #14110D;text-stroke:2px #14110D;}\n    .lab-outline-a h1 .oa-tick{color:#D262B2;-webkit-text-stroke:0;}\n    .lab-outline-a p.oa-sub{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(15px,1.7vw,19px);line-height:1.55;color:#4a443c;max-width:54ch;margin:28px auto 0;}\n    .lab-outline-a .oa-ctas{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;justify-content:center;align-items:center;margin-top:40px;}\n    .lab-outline-a .oa-cta-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#7CF067;color:#14110D;font-family:'Atelier',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(15px,1.6vw,17px);padding:16px 26px;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none;transition:transform .18s ease,box-shadow .18s ease;box-shadow:0 6px 0 #14110D;}\n    .lab-outline-a .oa-cta-primary:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 0 #14110D;}\n    .lab-outline-a .oa-cta-primary img{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:5px;display:block;}\n    .lab-outline-a .oa-cta-primary .oa-arrow{font-size:1.15em;line-height:1;transition:transform .18s ease;}\n    .lab-outline-a .oa-cta-primary:hover .oa-arrow{transform:translateX(4px);}\n    .lab-outline-a .oa-cta-secondary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:#14110D;font-family:'Atelier',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(15px,1.6vw,17px);padding:16px 22px;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none;border:2px solid #14110D;transition:background .18s ease,color .18s ease;}\n    .lab-outline-a .oa-cta-secondary:hover{background:#14110D;color:#FFFFFF;}\n    .lab-outline-a .oa-deco{position:absolute;pointer-events:none;z-index:1;}\n    .lab-outline-a .oa-star-1{top:11%;left:7%;width:clamp(46px,7vw,86px);animation:outline-a-starspin 18s linear infinite;opacity:.95;}\n    .lab-outline-a .oa-star-2{bottom:13%;right:8%;width:clamp(38px,5.5vw,66px);animation:outline-a-floaty 6s ease-in-out infinite;}\n    .lab-outline-a .oa-frag{top:14%;right:9%;width:clamp(70px,11vw,150px);mix-blend-mode:multiply;opacity:.9;animation:outline-a-floaty2 8s ease-in-out infinite;}\n    .lab-outline-a .oa-eye{bottom:9%;left:8%;width:clamp(54px,8vw,104px);mix-blend-mode:multiply;opacity:.85;animation:outline-a-floaty 7s ease-in-out infinite;}\n    .lab-outline-a .oa-logo{position:absolute;top:26px;left:28px;z-index:4;height:24px;width:auto;color:#14110D;}\n    @keyframes outline-a-starspin{to{transform:rotate(360deg);}}\n    @keyframes outline-a-floaty{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);}50%{transform:translateY(-14px);}}\n    @keyframes outline-a-floaty2{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0) rotate(0deg);}50%{transform:translateY(12px) rotate(4deg);}}\n    @media(max-width:600px){\n      .lab-outline-a .oa-frag,.lab-outline-a .oa-eye{display:none;}\n      .lab-outline-a .oa-ctas{flex-direction:column;}\n      .lab-outline-a .oa-cta-primary,.lab-outline-a .oa-cta-secondary{width:100%;justify-content:center;}\n    }\n  </style>\n\n  <svg class=\"oa-logo\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#kal-word\"/></svg>\n\n  <img class=\"oa-deco oa-star-1\" src=\"/v2/elements/grafismo-estrela-rosa-01.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <img class=\"oa-deco oa-star-2\" src=\"/v2/elements/grafismo-estrela-verde-01.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <img class=\"oa-deco oa-frag\" src=\"/v2/elements/grafismo-fragmentos-rosa.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <img class=\"oa-deco oa-eye\" src=\"/v2/elements/elemento-olho-halftone-pb.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n\n  <div class=\"oa-wrap\">\n    <span class=\"oa-eyebrow\"><span class=\"oa-dot\"></span>Agencia nativa do mercado cripto · desde 2020</span>\n    <h1>Criatividade que move o mercado <span class=\"oa-out\">cripto<span class=\"oa-tick\">.</span></span></h1>\n    <p class=\"oa-sub\">Conteudo, estrategia e lancamentos para marcas web3 que querem ser referencia, nao so mais ruido no feed.</p>\n    <div class=\"oa-ctas\">\n      <a class=\"oa-cta-primary\" href=\"https://calendly.com/madureira-kaleidosdigital/30min\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <img src=\"/v2/calendly-icon.webp\" alt=\"\">\n        Consultoria gratis\n        <span class=\"oa-arrow\">&rarr;</span>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"oa-cta-secondary\" href=\"/cases\">Ver cases <span class=\"oa-arrow\">&rarr;</span></a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
