    "note": "Concept Underline Verde A: marca-texto verde solido ATRAS de \"move o mercado cripto\" (texto ink por cima), layout esquerda canonico, accents rosa, CTAs ink.",
    "html": "<section class=\"lab-underline-a\" style=\"height:100%;min-height:520px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden;position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;background:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;\"><style>.lab-underline-a h1,.lab-underline-a h1 *{white-space:normal !important;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-break:normal;} .lab-underline-a{overflow:hidden;}</style>\n  <style>\n    .lab-underline-a *{box-sizing:border-box;}\n    .lab-underline-a .ua-wrap{width:100%;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px;position:relative;z-index:3;}\n    .lab-underline-a .ua-eyebrow{font-family:'Gridlite',monospace;font-size:clamp(11px,1.1vw,13px);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b6258;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;margin:0 0 26px;}\n    .lab-underline-a .ua-eyebrow::before{content:\"\";width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#D262B2;display:inline-block;flex:none;}\n    .lab-underline-a h1{font-family:'Atelier',sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#14110D;font-size:clamp(38px,6.6vw,76px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 26px;max-width:14ch;}\n    .lab-underline-a .ua-mark{position:relative;display:inline;white-space:nowrap;}\n    .lab-underline-a .ua-mark > span{position:relative;z-index:2;}\n    .lab-underline-a .ua-mark::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:-.06em;right:-.06em;bottom:.04em;height:.42em;background:#7CF067;z-index:1;border-radius:2px;transform:skewX(-3deg);}\n    .lab-underline-a p.ua-sub{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(16px,1.7vw,20px);line-height:1.55;color:#4a443c;max-width:50ch;margin:0 0 38px;}\n    .lab-underline-a .ua-cta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;align-items:center;}\n    .lab-underline-a a.ua-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#14110D;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Gridlite',monospace;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;padding:16px 26px;border-radius:50px;transition:transform .18s ease,background .18s ease;}\n    .lab-underline-a a.ua-primary img{width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;display:block;}\n    .lab-underline-a a.ua-primary .ua-arrow{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:17px;transition:transform .18s ease;}\n    .lab-underline-a a.ua-primary:hover{background:#000;transform:translateY(-2px);}\n    .lab-underline-a a.ua-primary:hover .ua-arrow{transform:translateX(4px);}\n    .lab-underline-a a.ua-secondary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:#14110D;font-family:'Gridlite',monospace;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;padding:16px 22px;border:1.5px solid #14110D;border-radius:50px;transition:background .18s ease,color .18s ease;}\n    .lab-underline-a a.ua-secondary:hover{background:#14110D;color:#FFFFFF;}\n    .lab-underline-a .ua-deco{position:absolute;pointer-events:none;z-index:1;}\n    .lab-underline-a .ua-star{top:9%;right:8%;width:clamp(60px,8vw,108px);animation:underline-a-starspin 22s linear infinite;opacity:.95;}\n    .lab-underline-a .ua-blob{bottom:-7%;right:-4%;width:clamp(180px,26vw,340px);opacity:.5;animation:underline-a-floaty 9s ease-in-out infinite;mix-blend-mode:multiply;}\n    .lab-underline-a .ua-frag{bottom:8%;left:-3%;width:clamp(90px,12vw,150px);opacity:.35;animation:underline-a-floaty2 11s ease-in-out infinite;mix-blend-mode:multiply;}\n    @keyframes underline-a-starspin{from{transform:rotate(0deg);}to{transform:rotate(360deg);}}\n    @keyframes underline-a-floaty{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);}50%{transform:translateY(-16px);}}\n    @keyframes underline-a-floaty2{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);}50%{transform:translateY(12px);}}\n    @media (max-width:640px){\n      .lab-underline-a .ua-blob{opacity:.32;}\n      .lab-underline-a a.ua-primary,.lab-underline-a a.ua-secondary{flex:1;justify-content:center;}\n      .lab-underline-a h1{max-width:100%;}\n    }\n  </style>\n\n  <img class=\"ua-deco ua-star\" src=\"/v2/elements/grafismo-estrela-rosa-01.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <img class=\"ua-deco ua-blob\" src=\"/v2/elements/grafismo-blob-rosa-verde.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <img class=\"ua-deco ua-frag\" src=\"/v2/elements/grafismo-fragmentos-rosa.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n\n  <div class=\"ua-wrap\">\n    <p class=\"ua-eyebrow\">Agencia nativa do mercado cripto · desde 2020</p>\n    <h1>Criatividade que <span class=\"ua-mark\"><span>move o mercado cripto</span></span>.</h1>\n    <p class=\"ua-sub\">Conteudo, estrategia e lancamentos para marcas web3 que querem ser referencia, nao so mais ruido no feed.</p>\n    <div class=\"ua-cta\">\n      <a class=\"ua-primary\" href=\"https://calendly.com/madureira-kaleidosdigital/30min\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <img src=\"/v2/calendly-icon.webp\" alt=\"\">\n        Consultoria gratis\n        <span class=\"ua-arrow\">&rarr;</span>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"ua-secondary\" href=\"/cases\">Ver cases</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
